(BUILD METHOD AND RESUME POINT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(KARPATHY / EVIDENCE-FIRST) Tj
T*
(- Start with the smallest measurable baseline.) Tj
T*
(- Change one variable at a time.) Tj
T*
(- Verify every change and preserve a rollback path.) Tj
T*
(- Never replace a real test with an 'it should work' claim.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CAVEMAN MODE) Tj
T*
(- One objective per step.) Tj
T*
(- Simple language, obvious buttons/commands, visible PASS/FAIL.) Tj
T*
(- When troubleshooting, reduce the system until the failure is isolated.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ENGAGEMENT) Tj
T*
(- Always show device role, model, download state, room/API status, and next action.) Tj
T*
(- Avoid dead screens and unexplained waiting.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(RESUME - DO NOT RESTART RESEARCH) Tj
T*
(1. Run PC + one iPhone/iPad baseline and get PHONE-CLUSTER-OK.) Tj
T*
(2. Run local API bridge and verify chat/completions.) Tj
T*
(3. Connect AnythingLLM or a coding agent.) Tj
T*
(4. Add a second mobile device and benchmark.) Tj
T*
(5. Test a larger model only after baseline stability.) Tj
T*
(6. Expand the Z Cluster dashboard.) Tj
